    {
      "id": "b93dfb11-ede0-47b1-b945-eafb4766e920",
      "title": "Leia a observação curta e repare na economia da frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "ea82177c-6f7c-4194-97ef-75770194bcf7",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Mío</strong> ajuda a dizer que algo é seu quando o objeto já está claro na cena.</p><p>Em vez de repetir <strong>mi móvil</strong>, você pode dizer: <strong>Este móvil es mío.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "bad18f0d-7faa-4f03-b7ec-528ddd77a373",
      "title": "Escute e acompanhe a frase em espanhol.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "8952adb4-7b93-427d-80b2-57745fbb25e9",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora veja a posse de outra pessoa.</p><p><strong>Esta cartera es tuya.</strong></p><p>Em português: Esta carteira é sua.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/ff5d8a0ce0cb4a39b43bd8bc6490b4bf_b04-esta-cartera-es-tuya.mp3?Expires=1794099471&Signature=RN2BvqBkCxk-~plnEW7hC47rwsrhe~lf5er36t71xxKmVx8~dVDfgVOpLDyK2-omkHwlktop8YF3umYQMUIkw7SFwnwDRsU4Szv6cKKsiFf8UW~sjppKfis0-uv~Qez2qIl-FpJ4EdTQWM4FuwubNvOjzQlU1vgH~sQ0ddcUZU15rOwbWR5o3ibQiWuDXNxtosK8kZxHO60haku~lrE~x-6ymHUPaC-nI1mkX18wlMig6Jt~WKw4JUBv74Un-qZysw~~pgDsShD9G6aba2y3NsH4drShqCgiAaWA3GPI9hx7s1TaZUO-UfPwD05HBIRqUNGtb538iIgXuR1JmANm4Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "a533ff74-64e1-4565-a154-ef76bafe9dbc",
      "title": "Compare as duas frases e observe o final de cada palavra.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "a976324a-f11d-4ab0-a196-0417da64e0e6",
          "textContent": "<p>As palavras de posse mudam conforme o objeto e a pessoa.</p><ul><li><strong>Este móvil es mío.</strong></li><li><strong>Esta cartera es tuya.</strong></li></ul><p>O espanhol ajusta a forma para combinar com o objeto visível e com quem ele pertence.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d5b02ade-23fe-499e-b6c7-3c8e2a0dfd9e",
      "title": "Escute e acompanhe a nova frase curta.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "1cdc74b7-eef0-47f8-bb02-ceca74204ad3",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora o padrão aparece com outro objeto do capítulo.</p><p><strong>Las gafas son mías.</strong></p><p>Em português: Os óculos são meus.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/2aa29a0ed2ab4499a83f8e5cf4cc7ed5_b06-las-gafas-son-mias.mp3?Expires=1794099471&Signature=CxZFMPr8PTMSyDd7Yr42IOy4PqgwQXwFQKq-PaWmKcdY98uGarUNXFL1H6vXv9wyV2z6~WuYEgS-Cl5CvfmWkOUClFALxRVSTBd3uTjQPYLP0klXx2GBxTIAvonPlItYy8g1treBOZX8rZDZnSB2UyCpUhIHegUwA5OSWv8l1gjGDy5MvzFDzxjNkqkHz45C5VB5Hp~yXLsu-j9P3kROb4UsGVLuAV9MPqZYNxSRr2Q2Ck9Bh10bKPZL6stacZ64sDFjndWRW5miYb0Tu9L5JG4yjIdORtOuNXyFhM35wZcslpzzBaJMk0BEPBkW~Qlxkv591kjJPK8ioMeE8JT-DQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
